| Logistics, pop-ups, and experiential trial | 10% | US$150,000 |
| Research, measurement, legal, and contingency | 13% | US$195,000 |

These figures are not a universal budget recommendation. If the budget is smaller, reduce the number of countries, SKUs, or channels rather than spreading insufficient resources across all of them.

